            "designerCredit": "The Lumière Dress was designed by Jalal Mashhadi Fard for NOUSHELLA.",
            "description": "The Lumière Dress is a reflection of the intricate latticework found in Persian architecture—those mesmerizing geometric patterns often seen in historic mosques, rich with mystery and symbolism. There is a certain radiance to them, an almost spiritual glow that became the essence of this design.\n\nCreated for NOUSHELLA, this piece is part of the Hestia Collection: a tribute to women with deep intuition and quiet strength. The patterns, layered with meaning, give the dress a sense of heritage and depth while celebrating the grace and presence of the woman who wears it.",
